  "identity": "Radboud fulltimeEnglishIBA specialisation ofBScBedrijfskunde50645;noDutchvariant/honourscurriculum mixed.",
  "allocation": "Current adopted31August2026 Dutch OER Annex3 pp33–34: exact English IBA specialisation of ordinary fulltime BScBedrijfskunde50645,10required6ECunits inB1,10inB2,and3required6ECunits plus12ECthesis and30ECopen inB3=180. English OER confirms allocation; Dutch controls. Article16 links first-year English academic-language assessment to an existing unit,no extraEC. Article17 requires open-unit approval,nonoverlap and normally no master/HBO units; Article20 governs foreign learning agreements. Optional18ECminors use part of30open,as may6/12/24ECinternships;none compulsory.42EC BSA. All25components/180allocatedEC independently verified,not a certified coherent degree pathway because thesisentry conflict remains. Fresh catalogue gives102EC plusAS/QM1/SustainableEntrepreneurship,versusOER90EC plusAS/Statistics/MRI. QuantitativeMethods2 presumesQM1;SustainableEntrepreneurship expects first-yearAS/IntroIB/ResponsibleOrganisation;OrganisationDesign360 expectsIntroIB/OrganisationTheory and has mandatoryseminars;SystemTheory hasno prior knowledge but mandatoryworkinggroups/assignment before exam;QualitativeMethods requires participation,assignments andpeerfeedback. AdvancedStrategy extends completed precedingStrategy. The retained nominal sequence supplies known current prerequisites,including120EC beforeB3,but no equivalence for legacyMRI is inferred. MAN-MOR002 currentcourse hasno prior knowledge yetOER restricts it to premaster enrolment;its existence is not an ordinarybachelor bridge.",
  "essentialEvidence": "Reconcile current IBA thesis-entry rules for the renewed curriculum: adopted Dutch OER Annex4 p35 requires90programmeEC including Academic Skills,Statistics and Methods of Research and Intervention; current2026 MAN-BIM301 catalogue instead requires102EC including Academic Skills,Quantitative Methods1 and Sustainable Entrepreneurship. Article41 explicitly replaces old Statistics with QM1 only for earlier students,not the missing Methods of Research and Intervention condition. Obtain an applicable formal amendment,precedence or explicit renewed-cohort equivalence. Do not waive the formal rule or insert the premaster-only MAN-MOR002 into an ordinary pathway.",
  "officialAlternative": "Both current Dutch/EnglishOER andcurrent26catalogue entries inspected;strongofficial-domainsearch finds olderOER andunrelatedprogrammes,not an applicableMRIcohortbridge orpriorityamendment. Currentcatalogue is substantive positive evidence,not a failedportal. No login,browser/universitycontact.",
  "moduleCautions": "MAN-BCU360 is the correctEnglishIBAOrganisationDesign;Dutch320 inspected as a comparison lead only,not substituted. MAN-BIN131BA embeds currentprogrammepage in content;script/style stripped andactual course paragraph inspected. No rawmodule research copied into reader prose."
